   - The Probate Court is also responsible for the appointment of guardians
  and conservators\, adoptions\, and name changes for the citizens of Pisca
 taquis County. Hearings on these matters are conducted before the Judge of
  Probate.\n  - You may view all Piscataquis County probate records (with t
 he exception of adoptions conducted after August 1953) at\n  - www.mainepr
